       [[[5], [7]], [[13], [15]]],
       [[[6], [8]], [[14], [16]]]]
  ```

  (4) For the following input of shape `[2, 2, 4, 1]`, block_shape = `[2, 2]`, and
      paddings = `[[0, 0], [2, 0]]`:

  ```
  x = [[[[1],   [2],  [3],  [4]],
